      <pronunciation_explanation>The demonstrative adjectives <b>esta</b> and <b>este</b> do not have an accent mark. The demonstrative pronouns <b>ésta</b> and <b>éste</b> have an accent mark on the first syllable. The verb forms <b>está</b> (present indicative) and <b>esté</b> (present subjunctive) have an accent mark on the last syllable.</pronunciation_explanation>
